            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest_size = jeans_sizes.min()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Powinno to być <code>min(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy zapisać najmniejszej wartości w zmiennej</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Z kodem wszystko jest w porządku</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Powinno to być <code>min(jeans_sizes)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czym należy zastąpić drugi wiersz, aby poprawnie zapisać <code>25</code> w <code>smallest_size</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest_size = jeans_sizes.min()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>smallest_size = min(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>smallest_size = max(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>smallest_size = jeans_sizes.min()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>smallest_size = min(jeans_sizes)</code>.</p></body></html>",
