          {
            "title": "Question: Minimum",
            "id": 82715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co to wyświetla w konsoli? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>60</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[200, 500, 60, 90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsola poniżej pokazuje <code>60</code> dla kodu w obecnej postaci. Co wyświetliłaby, gdyby <code>60</code> zostało usunięte z <code>light_intensity</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>90</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj <code>vocabulary.sort()</code>, aby posortować słowa ze słownika alfabetycznie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vocabulary = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bridge&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;car&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vocabulary.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vocabulary)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bridge', 'car', 'key']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>vocabulary.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Ascending order",
            "id": 82734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka będzie pierwsza liczba na liście po sortowaniu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Żadna, ponieważ kod sortowania jest nieprawidłowy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która wartość znajdzie się pod indeksem <code>2</code> po posortowaniu listy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Powinno to być <code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Z kodem wszystko jest w porządku</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Możemy używać <code>sort()</code> tylko wewnątrz instrukcji <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Powinno to być <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czym należy zastąpić drugi wiersz, aby posortować listę <code>active_users</code> od najmniejszej do największej wartości?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort(active_users)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>active_users = sort()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Float and Integer",
            "id": 82741,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Posortuj te pomiary wzrostu w kolejności rosnącej za pomocą <code>.sort()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"heights = [\" /><text value=\"166\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"172.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"159.4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"heights.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(heights)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"44\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[159.4, 166, 172.6]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82737,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które imię pojawi się jako pierwsze w <code>contacts</code> po sortowaniu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Ana\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Ava\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Bill\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Ana\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Ava\"</code> i <code>\"Ana\"</code> zaczynają się od <code>A</code>. Dlaczego <code>sort()</code> umieszcza <code>\"Ana\"</code> na pierwszym miejscu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Druga litera <code>n</code> jest wcześniej w alfabecie niż <code>v</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> odwraca kolejność, w jakiej zapisano imiona.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> umieszcza krótsze imiona przed dłuższymi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Druga litera <code>n</code> jest wcześniej w alfabecie niż <code>v</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82860,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Powinno to być <code>sum(cart)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy użyć <code>sum()</code>, ponieważ <code>cart</code> nie jest listą</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Z kodem wszystko jest w porządku</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Powinno to być <code>sum(cart)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czym należy zastąpić drugi wiersz, aby kod wyświetlił łączną wartość koszyka, czyli <code>87</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(max(cart))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(cart.sum())</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print(sum(cart))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
